Nope.

The sequence:

Pick up AC 1 armor
Rustproof
Be attacked by rusting agent
enchant
Be attacked by rusting agent
enchant to max
Be attacked by rusting agent

versus

Pick up AC 1 armor
Be attacked by rusting agent
enchant
Be attacked by rusting agent
enchant
enchant to max
Be attacked by rusting agent
Rustproof
enchant to max

uses fewer scrolls and leaves the PC less vulnerable for
most of the turns covered. The point of rustproofing first
is that later enchantments aren't wasted catering for
rusting. That kind of calculation holds even for the early
game.

